  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EU for SME development</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Global objective &lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;To develop SME policy framework in line with EU strategic priorities and to increase capacities of public administration to better develop programmes and measures, as well as monitoring and evaluation indicators.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Specific objectives&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;To develop national SME strategy 2024-2030 and Action Plan in line with the EU strategic priorities and good EU practices;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;To set up of the monitoring and evaluation (M&amp;E) mechanism for implementation of the SME Strategy;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;To increase capacity of public&amp;nbsp;bodies in charge of formulating, coordinating, andimplementing public policy measures on SME policy ;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&#xb7;To support public and private stakeholders to design programmes and instruments/measures for implementation of the Strategy and Action Plan;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;.To improve access to the EU programmes for SMEs, by capacity building of relevant stakeholders and development of systematic support structures&lt;/p&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
